    {
      "content": "Do not under estimate your ability to, to affect like the move by how well you can reconcile the boxes you're already like, maybe about a month out from the actual move itself and the state that your home is in currently already looks good, honestly it looks like it should be very manageable once you get to the stages of actually being, being able to start packing up more if you're able to, to just consolidate as much as you can into boxes. So that there's very little miscellaneous items if any left for the movers that will give them the strongest chance of, of being able to save you the most time and money on your move with regardless of which, which moving company you choose to move forward with.",
