      "type": "transcript"
    },
    {
      "content": "For us near, it's pretty much the same numbers that we discussed on the previous call yesterday. I do believe that it would take about four and a half hours for two movers to load up the truck with your inventory. There the main reason why I wouldn't necessarily bring that down even though I do feel like it's within ear shot for them to actually beat that load uptime it's just because I don't want to underestimate unmount the.",
      "name": "Alexander Tran",
      "time": "2026-09-02T20:51:33.226705",
